{"parse": {"title": "TTS-21", "pageid": 141726, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-20\" title=\"TTS-20\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-21</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-22\" title=\"TTS-22\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">21</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9D.99.E8.B0.A7.E4.B8.8E.E5.85.89.E6.98.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"静谧与光明\">静谧与光明</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 静谧与光明</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Silence and Light</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>静<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>光<span class=\"color-value\"></span>明<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>间<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>终<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>间<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>总<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>影<span class=\"color-value\"></span>徘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>徊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810121</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-632501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-632501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-632501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">电视主持人：</div><div>本台最新消息，截至今日凌晨四点，卡罗林斯卡医学院附属医院已累计接收三十七例疑似“电线人”患者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-632501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-632501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-632501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">电视主持人：</div><div>此外，多家医院急诊已出现拥堵状况，外科手术区域全面停摆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>现在我们看到，医院门口排队等待入院的队伍已经跨越了三个街区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>请民众切勿前往医院聚集，以免造成进一步风险——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_07\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-3_8_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-3_8_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-3_8_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-650217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-650217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-650217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……来不及了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图挂断通讯，面色苍白地转身面向同伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>距离基金会最后一班紧急避险航班起飞只剩不到两个小时，而最近的机场也在一百英里开外……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>如果我们从现在起一刻不停，以足以引来警察尾随的速度开向机场，或许还有机会……两位开车的技术如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声闷雷划破天际。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我记得上一次也是像这样的一个下雨天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>那你们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图环顾四周的居民。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>穹顶下的身影零星而孤单，或独自沉默，或互相低语，像是这片天地中最微不足道的存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>不必在意，孩子。你们已经为我们做得够多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>接下来，轮到我们为自己的命运负责了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>再见。我会想念你们的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女低下头，眼中闪动的色光如潮水般褪去，只剩苍白的底色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>事实上……现在我已经开始想念你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你们走吧，我留在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师靠在角落的石柱上，淡然啜饮手中的咖啡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人的目光几乎不约而同地转向她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……噢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>呵，意料之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师放下咖啡，面向众人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>从这个方案最早提出的那一刻起，我就想清楚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我会和居民们留在这里——不是作为旁观者，而是作为实验的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如果“时空灾害”来临，我们就在雨中等待。如果它终究要冲走什么——那就从站在这里的人开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>因为只有这样，实验才算完整。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>幸好我们想法一致，这样我就不需要花时间来说服你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不是用模型，不是用概率，也不是用“理论上可行”来证明什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而是用身体、用时间，去验证是否真的愿意承担自己所做的每一个判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>柏林以东小姐，你的看法呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柏林以东闭上眼，侧耳倾听着尚未到来的雨声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>我猜它彻底完成的时候，将雨水隔绝在外的模样，一定美极了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>我喜欢那样的景象——哪怕只存在一秒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>很好，现在我可以放心地宣布——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师大笑着举起手中的咖啡杯，像是在进行一场简短而正式的祝酒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>诸位现在已经是这项疯狂计划的共同责任人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天空乌云密布，人群渐渐密集起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>湿外套的气味混着泥土的气息，在穹顶下扩散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……怎么回事？这里的人数已经超出规划了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">居民Ⅳ：</div><div>那是我的姐姐……我们就占一点儿位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说话间，又有陌生的面孔从入口挤进来，怀里抱着裹在旧毛毯里的婴儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>这样不行，我们不能保证穹顶能保护这么多人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-521301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-521301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-521301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">居民Ⅲ：</div><div>实在抱歉，女士。我们……我们只是没办法把他们丢在外面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>居民们的眼神闪躲着，充满了歉疚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>这可有些不妙……被激活的回声石太少了，连穹顶一半面积都不到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>没有足够的位置给其他人了。可大多数人什么都不知道，我们不能贸然赶走他们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-564801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">居民Ⅰ：</div><div>不好……这是要下暴雨了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-521301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-521301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-521301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">居民Ⅲ：</div><div>和上次一样，“时空灾害”来的时候也下了很大的雨……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群乱作一团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声、低声的咒骂声交织在一起，外来的人们被不断推挤，逐渐被挤向角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们努力收紧身体，仿佛想让自己占用更小的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">居民Ⅱ：</div><div>嘶……谁踩到我的脚了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-639801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陌生的妇人：</div><div>抱歉。这里不该再进人了，我们马上就走……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣静静地站在角落，看着这一切，记忆翻涌而上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她曾在许多地方看到过这样的景象，不同的城市、乡镇、村落……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脆弱的人们、真实的人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……活下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>等一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>或许，我可以试试用神秘术在上面做个夹层，把其他人送上去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>别逞强，奠基石。你的手还没从上次战斗中完全恢复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>而且现在也来不及了，得先固定好支点……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>打断一下，现在恐怕不是争论的时候。你们看到回声谣了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群终于安静下来，数十双眼睛左右逡巡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这里早就没有了回声谣的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">居民Ⅱ：</div><div>我看到了！在天上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>天上？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人激动地指向穹顶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在半透明的天窗外，熟悉的、白色的衣裙正随风慢慢飘动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">居民Ⅱ：</div><div>看到了吗？她就站在外面——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-314013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-314014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……回声谣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>回声谣……快回来，你会消失的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我……已经在这片土地上存在过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>未来已经有人替我走过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>你们会记得彼此，也会记得这片土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>而我，将与那些消散的声音一起……守望你们，祝福你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我的归属，从来都不是明天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是那个刚刚结束，却又尚未开始的年代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意义尚未确立的年代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一无所有的年代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-314501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-314501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-314501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>愿你们都深信明天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>一切都从过去开始，从你们的愿望开始……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>歌声飘荡着，流淌过</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>河岸低语着，对我说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……再见，朋友们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>歌声消散后，穹顶的石头们一齐发出鸣响，那鸣响又逸散出万千金白的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——终于，在金光消逝的一瞬，暴雨落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杳远的鸣响散尽后，空间坠入无光的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起初，是一片黑暗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管如此，也没有人发出一丝声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人屏息静待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一束微弱的亮光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光亮越来越大，越来越白……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直至填满了整个空间——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">居民们：</div><div>哦……快看！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_27.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_27\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_27\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_8_at_27.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_27.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_8_at_27.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_27.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-3_8_at_27.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_27.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个完整的穹顶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朴素灰淡的三角体静悬高空，沉静地观望这个世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着三角体，均匀的、金色的光线流向大地，流向这片大地上的人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它拥抱着飞尘，如降临般充盈了整个空间，将暴雨隔绝在遥远的天际。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>真美啊……这是一个奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人的脸、女人的脸、孩子的脸……都被它温柔地抚摸、亲吻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，它轻轻流到奠基石的脚边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只剩一片寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那一瞬间，她回想起许多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四月的雏菊、秋千、地中海的写生、脸上有疤的老人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎所有的一切，都只为了这一刻而存在。为了指向这最后的、唯一而永恒的辉光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师闭上眼，让自己被这寂静淹没——就像小时候做过的那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你一直在，一直在等着我们来发现你……发现你存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她睁开眼，露出微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>虽然我还是第一次见到你，却已经觉得很熟悉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>就好像……我们已经认识了很久一样。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-21"}}